ValueSet: UnitsOfTimeVS
Id: units-of-time-vs
Title: "Units of Time ValueSet"
Description: "A value set defining common units of time (s, min, h, d, wk, mo, a) from UCUM."
* ^experimental = true
* ^language = #uz

// Включаем конкретные коды из UCUM
* $ucum#s
* $ucum#min
* $ucum#h
* $ucum#d
* $ucum#wk
* $ucum#mo
* $ucum#a